title RecruitBook Batch 1 — Authentication Account State Machine

' ============================================================
' SCOPE NOTE
' Durable account lifecycle states held in the RecruitBook
' application database. Login/logout and password reset are
' session/credential events, not lifecycle states (see notes).
' ============================================================

state "No Account" as NoAccount
state "Registration Rejected" as RegRejected <<security>>
state "Email Unverified" as EmailUnverified <<pending>>

state "Active Student" as ActiveStudent <<verified>>

state "Pending Counselor Approval" as PendingCounselor <<pending>>
state "Verified Counselor" as VerifiedCounselor <<verified>>

state "Pending Admissions Officer Approval" as PendingAdmissions <<pending>>
state "Verified Admissions Officer" as VerifiedAdmissions <<verified>>

state "Active Platform Administrator" as ActiveAdmin <<admin>>

state "Suspended" as Suspended <<security>>
state "Unauthorized Access Outcome" as Unauthorized <<security>>

' ============================================================
' PROTECTED ROUTE ELIGIBILITY (state descriptions)
' Each durable state advertises the route it is allowed to reach.
' ============================================================

EmailUnverified : Route → verification required page / restricted
ActiveStudent : Route → /student/dashboard
PendingCounselor : Route → /counselor/pending
VerifiedCounselor : Route → /counselor/dashboard
PendingAdmissions : Route → /admissions/pending
VerifiedAdmissions : Route → /admissions/dashboard
ActiveAdmin : Route → /admin/dashboard
Suspended : Route → /unauthorized
RegRejected : Outcome → registration error
Unauthorized : Outcome → /unauthorized

' ============================================================
' ENTRY: REGISTRATION & ADMIN PROVISIONING
' ============================================================

[*] --> NoAccount

NoAccount --> EmailUnverified : public registration succeeds\n[role ∈ {Student, Counselor,\nAdmissions Officer}]
NoAccount --> RegRejected : public registration attempt\n[role = Platform Administrator]
NoAccount --> ActiveAdmin : seeded / manual provisioning only\n(never public registration)

' ============================================================
' EMAIL VERIFICATION → ROLE-RESOLVED STATE
' Supabase Auth verifies the email; RecruitBook resolves the
' durable account_status from the stored application role.
' ============================================================

EmailUnverified --> ActiveStudent : [email verified AND role = Student]
EmailUnverified --> PendingCounselor : [email verified AND role = Counselor]
EmailUnverified --> PendingAdmissions : [email verified AND role = Admissions Officer]

' ============================================================
' ADMIN APPROVAL OF PRIVILEGED ROLES
' ============================================================

PendingCounselor --> VerifiedCounselor : Platform Administrator\napproves counselor
PendingAdmissions --> VerifiedAdmissions : Platform Administrator\napproves admissions officer

' ============================================================
' SUSPENSION (admin denial / security action)
' ============================================================

PendingCounselor --> Suspended : admin denies / suspends\n/ suspicious registration
PendingAdmissions --> Suspended : admin denies / suspends\n/ suspicious registration
ActiveStudent --> Suspended : admin suspension /\nsecurity action
VerifiedCounselor --> Suspended : admin suspension /\nsecurity action
VerifiedAdmissions --> Suspended : admin suspension /\nsecurity action
ActiveAdmin --> Suspended : privileged account\nsuspension / security action

' ============================================================
' UNAUTHORIZED ROUTING OUTCOME
' Suspended sessions and any invalid role/status combination
' resolve to the Unauthorized Access Outcome on a protected
' route request. Drawn from Suspended only to avoid clutter;
' the invalid-combination path is covered by the note below.
' ============================================================

Suspended --> Unauthorized : protected route requested\nwhile suspended

' ============================================================
' NOTES
' ============================================================

note right of NoAccount
  Platform Administrator accounts are
  never created through public
  registration. They are seeded or
  manually provisioned only.
end note

note bottom of EmailUnverified
  Supabase Auth verifies identity
  (email + credentials + session).
  RecruitBook role and account_status
  determine authorization. Pending
  Counselor and Pending Admissions
  accounts cannot reach verified-user
  dashboards.
end note

note right of Suspended
  Reinstatement: after admin review,
  a Suspended account returns to its
  previous valid role state
  (Active Student, Verified Counselor,
  Verified Admissions Officer, or
  Active Platform Administrator).
  Modeled as a note to avoid a
  spiderweb of reinstatement arrows.
  Suspended accounts are denied all
  protected-route access until then.
end note

note bottom of Unauthorized
  Any unknown or invalid role/status
  combination also resolves here.
  Protected routing must check the
  database role and account_status
  server-side — UI hiding is not
  authorization.
end note

note as SessionNote
  Out of scope as durable states:
  • Login / logout change session
    state, not account status.
  • Password reset changes credentials,
    not RecruitBook role / account_status.
  • Login lockout is a security control,
    not a lifecycle state.
  • Account deletion is a future slice.
end note

